{"id": "8th-u1-q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-tamilmozhi-vaazhthu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-grammar-punarchi-senthamizh", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'செந்தமிழ்' (செம்மை + தமிழ்) என்னும் சொல் புணரும் முறையையும் அதற்குரிய சரியான இலக்கண விதிகளையும் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "உடம்படுமெய் புணர்ச்சி; உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே", "B": "திசைப்பெயர் புணர்ச்சி; வல்லினம் மிகல்", "C": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்; ஆதிநீடல்", "D": "ஈறுபோதல் (மை கெட்டது); முன்னின்ற மெய்திரிதல் (மகர மெய் வருமொழி தகரத்திற்கு இனமான நகர மெய்யாகத் திரிந்தது)"}, "explanation": "இலக்கண விதி: 'செம்மை + தமிழ்' என்பதில் 'ஈறுபோதல்' விதியால் 'மை' கெட்டு 'செம் + தமிழ்' என்றானது. பின் 'முன்னின்ற மெய்திரிதல்' விதியால் வருமொழித் தகரத்திற்கு இனமான 'ந்' தோன்றி 'செந்தமிழ்' எனப் புணர்ந்தது. சரியான தெரிவு D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the sandhi operation and grammar rules governing 'Senthamizh' (Semmai + Thamizh):"}], "options": {"A": "Udambadumei sandhi; Consonant-vowel union", "B": "Directional noun sandhi; Hard consonant doubling", "C": "Short monosyllable doubling; Lengthening of first vowel", "D": "Eerupothal (suffix 'mai' drops); Munnintra Mei Thirithal (m -> n assimilating to t)"}, "explanation": "'Semmai + Thamizh' drops 'mai' via Eerupothal, and 'm' mutates to homorganic nasal 'n' before 'th' via Munnintra Mei Thirithal yielding Senthamizh. Key D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "punarchi", "eerupothal", "application"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u1-q021", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-tamilmozhi-vaazhthu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-grammar-edhugai-vaazhthu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாரதியாரின் 'தமிழ்மொழி வாழ்த்து' செய்யுளடிகளின் இரண்டாம் எழுத்து ஒன்றிவரும் 'எதுகை நயம்' அமைந்த சரியான சொற்களின் இணையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்க:"}], "options": {"A": "வாழ்க - ஏழ்கடல் - சூழ்கலி (இரண்டாம் எழுத்து 'ழ்' ஒன்றிவந்தது)", "B": "வாழ்க - வானம் - வண்மொழி (முதல் எழுத்து 'வா' ஒன்றிவந்தது)", "C": "எங்கும் - இசை - எங்கள் (முதல் எழுத்து 'எ' ஒன்றிவந்தது)", "D": "சுடர்க - தமிழ்நாடு - வாழியவே (இறுதிச் சீர்)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 2: 'வாழ்க', 'ஏழ்கடல்', 'சூழ்கலி' ஆகிய சொற்களில் இரண்டாம் எழுத்து 'ழ்' ஒன்றிவந்துள்ளதால் இது 'எதுகை' ஆகும். B மற்றும் C மோனைச் சொற்கள் ஆகும். எனவே சரியான எதுகைத் தெரிவு A."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the pair of words exhibiting second-letter rhyming concord (Edhugai) from Bharati's verse:"}], "options": {"A": "Vazhga - Eazhkadal - Soozhgali (second letter 'zh' rhyming)", "B": "Vazhga - Vaanam - Vanmozhi (first letter 'vaa' rhyming)", "C": "Engum - Isai - Engal (first letter 'e' rhyming)", "D": "Sudarka - Thamizhnaadu - Vaazhiyave (line terminal)"}, "explanation": "Second letter 'zh' rhymes across 'Vazhga', 'Eazhkadal', and 'Soozhgali', conforming to strict Edhugai rules. Key A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "edhugai", "prosody", "application"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u1-q022", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-aazhikku-inai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-grammar-maathirai-metrics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் யாப்பிலக்கண மாத்திரை விதிகளின்படி, 'சந்தக்கவிமணி' என்ற சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவு எத்தனை?"}], "options": {"A": "6 மாத்திரைகள்", "B": "7 மாத்திரைகள்", "C": "7.5 மாத்திரைகள்", "D": "8 மாத்திரைகள்"}, "explanation": "மாத்திரை கணக்கீடு:\nச = குறில் (1)\nந் = மெய் (0.5)\nத = குறில் (1)\nக் = மெய் (0.5)\nக = குறில் (1)\nவி = குறில் (1)\nம = குறில் (1)\nணி = குறில் (1)\nகூடுதல் = 1 + 0.5 + 1 + 0.5 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 7 மாத்திரைகள். சரியான தெரிவு B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to classical Tamil prosodic rules, what is the total duration measure in Matras for 'சந்தக்கவிமணி'?"}], "options": {"A": "6 Matras", "B": "7 Matras", "C": "7.5 Matras", "D": "8 Matras"}, "explanation": "Sa (1) + n (0.5) + tha (1) + k (0.5) + ka (1) + vi (1) + ma (1) + ni (1) = 7 Matras. Key B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_y