{"id": "8th-u1-q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-aazhikku-inai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-conch-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்க் கடலில் கிடைக்கும் மூன்று வகைச் சங்குகளின் குழுவில் உட்படாத பொருந்தாத வேறுபட்ட ஒன்று எது?"}], "options": {"A": "வெண்சங்கு", "B": "சலஞ்சலம்", "C": "பாஞ்சசன்யம்", "D": "மணிமுத்து (சங்கு அன்று; நவரத்தினங்களுள் ஒன்று)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 6: கடல் தரும் முச்சங்குகள்: வெண்சங்கு, சலஞ்சலம், பாஞ்சசன்யம் ஆகும். மணிமுத்து என்பது முத்து வகையாகும்; சங்கு அன்று. எனவே இது பொருந்தாதது (தெரிவு D)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following does NOT belong to the group of three classical conch shells yielded by the sea?"}], "options": {"A": "Vensangu", "B": "Salanjalam", "C": "Paanjajanyam", "D": "Manimuthu (Pearl / gem, not a conch shell)"}, "explanation": "The three conches are Vensangu, Salanjalam, and Paanjajanyam. Pearl (Manimuthu) is a gem, not a conch. Key D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_ye