{"id": "8th-u1-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-tamilmozhi-vaazhthu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-bharati-works-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மகாகவி பாரதியாரின் படைப்புகளுள் 'உரைநடை நூல்' என்ற வகைப்பாட்டில் பொருந்தாத வேறுபட்ட நூல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "சந்திரிகையின் கதை", "B": "பாஞ்சாலி சபதம் (காவியம் / செய்யுள் நூல்)", "C": "தராசு", "D": "பாரதியார் கட்டுரைகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 3: சந்திரிகையின் கதை, தராசு ஆகியன பாரதியாரின் புகழ்பெற்ற உரைநடை நூல்கள் ஆகும். பாஞ்சாலி சபதம் என்பது பாரதியாரின் முப்பெரும் காப்பியங்களுள் (கண்ணன் பாட்டு, குயில் பாட்டு, பாஞ்சாலி சபதம்) ஒன்றான செய்யுள் காப்பியமாகும். எனவே இது பொருந்தாதது (தெரிவு B)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following works of Mahakavi Bharati does NOT belong to the category of prose works (Urainadai)?"}], "options": {"A": "Chandrikaiyin Kathai", "B": "Panchali Sabatham (Epic poem / Verse)", "C": "Tharasu", "D": "Bharati Essays"}, "explanation": "Panchali Sabatham is a narrative verse epic, whereas Chandrikaiyin Kathai and Tharasu are prose compositions. Hence B is the odd one out. Key B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["bharathiyar", "prose_vs_poetry", "odd_one_out"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u1-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-aazhikku-inai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-tamilazhaganar-sitrilakkiyam-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இளம் வயதிலேயே இலக்கணப் புலமையும் செய்யுள் ஆற்றலும் பெற்ற சந்தக்கவிமணி தமிழழகனார் இயற்றிய சிற்றிலக்கிய நூல்களின் எண்ணிக்கை எத்தனை?"}], "options": {"A": "8 சிற்றிலக்கிய நூல்கள்", "B": "10 சிற்றிலக்கிய நூல்கள்", "C": "12 சிற்றிலக்கிய நூல்கள்", "D": "16 சிற்றிலக்கிய நூல்கள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 6: சந்தக்கவிமணி தமிழழகனார் பன்னிரண்டு (12) சிற்றிலக்கிய நூல்களைப் படைத்துள்ளார் என நூல்வெளியில் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது. சரியான தெரிவு C."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many Sitrilakkiyam (minor literary) works were composed by Sandhakkavimani Tamilazhaganar?"}], "options": {"A": "8 Sitrilakkiyam works", "B": "10 Sitrilakkiyam works", "C": "12 Sitrilakkiyam works", "D": "16 Sitrilakkiyam works"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 6 states that Tamilazhaganar authored 12 Sitrilakkiyam works. Key C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamilazhaganar", "sitrilakkiyam", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u1-q028", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-aazhikku-inai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-siledai-definition-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் இலக்கியத்தில் ஒரு சொல்லோ தொடரோ இரு பொருள்பட வருமாறு பாடப்படும் அணியின் பெயர் யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "உருவக அணி", "C": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "D": "இரட்டுற மொழிதல் அணி (சிலேடை அணி)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 6: ஒரு சொல்லோ தொடரோ இரு பொருள்பட வருவது 'இரட்டுற மொழிதல் அணி' எனப்படும்; இதனைச் 'சிலேடை அணி' என்றும் அழைப்பர். சரியான தெரிவு D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Tamil poetics, what is the figure of speech called when a word or sentence yields two distinct meanings?"}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai Ani", "B": "Uruvaga Ani", "C": "Vaetrumai Ani", "D": "Irattura Mozhithal Ani (Siledai Ani)"}, "explanation": "When a linguistic expression produces two concurrent meanings, it is classified as Irattura Mozhithal Ani (Siledai). Key D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ani_ilakkanam", "siledai", "direct_mcq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

