{"id": "8th-u1-q056", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-varivadiva-valarchi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-periyar-year-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்நாடு அரசால் தந்தை பெரியாரின் தமிழ் எழுத்துச் சீர்திருத்தங்கள் அதிகாரப்பூர்வமாக நடைமுறைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட ஆண்டு எது?"}], "options": {"A": "1967", "B": "1971", "C": "1975", "D": "1978"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 11: தந்தை பெரியாரின் எழுத்துச் சீர்திருத்தங்கள் சில ஏற்கப்பட்டு 1978-ஆம் ஆண்டு தமிழ்நாடு அரசால் நடைமுறைப்படுத்தப்பட்டன. சரியான தெரிவு D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year did the Government of Tamil Nadu officially enact Thanthai Periyar's Tamil script reforms?"}], "options": {"A": "1967", "B": "1971", "C": "1975", "D": "1978"}, "explanation": "Periyar's script modernization was officially adopted by Tamil Nadu Government in 1978. Key D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 11, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_