{"id": "8th-u1-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05b-iyal1-integration", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-grammar-word-building-counts", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 22-ல் தரப்பட்டுள்ள 'மா, தேன், மலர், செம்மை, சிட்டு, கனி, கூடு, மரம்' ஆகிய சொற்களைக் கொண்டு உருவாக்கத்தக்க இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகைச் சொல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "தேன்மலர்", "B": "சிட்டுக்குருவி", "C": "மாமரம்", "D": "செங்கனி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 22: 'மா' என்பது மரங்களுள் ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட மரத்தைக் குறிக்கும் சிறப்புப் பெயர்; 'மரம்' என்பது பொதுப்பெயர். சிறப்புப் பெயர் முன்னும் பொதுப்பெயர் பின்னும் அமைந்து 'ஆகிய' என்னும் உருபு மறைந்து வருவதால் 'மாமரம்' இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which compound coined from the word list on page 22 (Maa, Thaen, Malar, Semmai, Chittu, Kani, Koodu, Maram) constitutes an Irupeyarottu Panpuththogai?"}], "options": {"A": "Thenmalar", "B": "Chittukkuruvi", "C": "Maamaram", "D": "Sengani"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 22: In 'Maamaram', 'Maa' (Mango) is the specific noun and 'Maram' (tree) is the generic noun, forming Irupeyarottu Panpuththogai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 22, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "compounds", "irupeyarottu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u1-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05b-iyal1-integration", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-odd-bharathidasan-books", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புரட்சிக் கவிஞர் பாரதிதாசன் இயற்றிய நூல்களுள் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்க:"}], "options": {"A": "பாண்டியன் பரிசு", "B": "அழகின் சிரிப்பு", "C": "இருண்ட வீடு", "D": "பாஞ்சாலி சபதம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 20: 'பாஞ்சாலி சபதம்' என்பது மகாகவி பாரதியார் இயற்றிய முப்பெரும் காவியங்களுள் ஒன்றாகும். பாரதிதாசன் இயற்றியவை: பாண்டியன் பரிசு, அழகின் சிரிப்பு, குடும்ப விளக்கு, இருண்ட வீடு, இசையமுது போன்றவை. எனவே 'பாஞ்சாலி சபதம்' பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the book that was NOT authored by Puratchi Kavignar Bharathidasan:"}], "options": {"A": "Pandiyan Parisu", "B": "Azhagin Sirippu", "C": "Irunda Veedu", "D": "Paanchaali Sabatham"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 20: 'Paanchaali Sabatham' was authored by Subramania Bharati. Bharathidasan wrote Pandiyan Parisu, Azhagin Sirippu, and Irunda Veedu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Serv